@startuml deployment-production
'==============================================================
' BrewLite – UML Deployment diagram cho môi trường production
' Nền tảng thực tế: Render (xem ADR-006)
' Task 3.2 (Assignment 2)
'==============================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F5F7FA
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  FontColor #1B2631
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #5D6D7E
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EAEDED
  BorderColor #2C3E50
  FontColor #1B2631
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #FDEBD0
  BorderColor #B9770E
  FontColor #5D4037
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #F5F7FA
  BorderColor #2C3E50
}
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #5D6D7E
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam ArrowFontColor #2C3E50
skinparam linetype ortho

title BrewLite – Deployment Diagram (Production: Render)

'---------------- Thiết bị người dùng ----------------
node "Thiết bị người dùng\n(Trình duyệt / PWA\nmobile-first)" as Device {
  artifact "PWA bundle\n(manifest + service worker)" as PWA
}

'---------------- CI ----------------
node "CI – GitHub Actions\n(.github/workflows/)" as CI {
  component "Job: lint & test\n(quality gate)" as JobTest
  component "Job: build\nDocker image" as JobBuild
  component "Job: push registry\n+ deploy + smoke test" as JobCD
}

'---------------- Registry ----------------
node "Container Registry\nDocker Hub" as Registry {
  artifact "brewlite-web:<commit-sha>" as ImgWeb
  artifact "brewlite-api:<commit-sha>" as ImgApi
  artifact "brewlite-web:latest" as ImgWebLatest
  artifact "brewlite-api:latest" as ImgApiLatest
}

'---------------- Production: Render ----------------
node "Nền tảng triển khai – Render (PaaS)" as Render {

  node "Web Service: brewlite-web\n(Container Docker)" as WebSvc {
    artifact "Image: brewlite-web:<sha>\nNext.js 20 + Node 20-alpine\noutput: 'standalone'" as ImgWebRun
    component "Next.js Server\n(App Router, SSR/CSR)\nPort: $PORT (Render cấp)\nHTTPS do Render cấp chứng chỉ" as NextRun
  }

  node "Web Service: brewlite-api\n(Container Docker)" as ApiSvc {
    artifact "Image: brewlite-api:<sha>\nNestJS + Prisma\nNode 20-alpine (non-root)" as ImgApiRun
    component "NestJS API\nModules: products, auth,\norders, payments, loyalty, health" as NestRun
    component "EntryPoint\nprisma migrate deploy\n&& node dist/main.js" as Entrypoint
  }

  node "PostgreSQL 15 – Managed\nbrewlite-db" as DBSvc {
    database "PostgreSQL\nPersistent Storage (Render Disk)\nInternal URL – KHÔNG public" as PG
  }
}

'---------------- Local ----------------
node "Môi trường LOCAL\n(docker-compose.yml)" as Local {
  component "Container brewlite_web\nNext.js :3000" as LocalWeb
  component "Container brewlite_api\nNestJS :4000" as LocalApi
  component "Container brewlite_postgres\nPostgreSQL :5432" as LocalDB
}

'---------------- Quan hệ CI / Registry ----------------
CI --> JobTest
JobTest --> JobBuild : quality gate pass\n(lint + test + build)
JobBuild --> Registry : docker push\n(tag = commit SHA)
JobCD --> Registry : docker pull\n(image tag theo SHA)

'---------------- Quan hệ Render ----------------
Registry --> WebSvc : deploy image\nbrewlite-web:<sha>
Registry --> ApiSvc : deploy image\nbrewlite-api:<sha>
NextRun ..> NestRun : HTTPS /api/v1/*\n(CORS allowlist)
Entrypoint --> PG : prisma migrate deploy\n(prisma:// — internal network)
NestRun --> PG : Prisma client\ninternal connection\n(port 5432)
NestRun ..> DBSvc : Health Check Path\nGET /health

'---------------- Quan hệ người dùng ----------------
Device --> NextRun : **HTTPS 443**\nhttps://brewlite-web.onrender.com
Device --> NestRun : **HTTPS 443**\nhttps://brewlite-api.onrender.com/api/v1\nhttps://brewlite-api.onrender.com/health

'---------------- Local ----------------
LocalWeb --> LocalApi : http://localhost:4000\n(HTTP nội bộ)
LocalApi --> LocalDB : postgresql://…@localhost:5432

note right of Device
  **Ranh giới người dùng**
  • Chỉ truy cập qua **HTTPS**
  • Không truy cập trực tiếp DB
  • PWA cache tài nguyên tĩnh
end note

note bottom of DBSvc
  **Ranh giới dữ liệu**
  • Database **không** public trực tiếp
  • Chỉ truy cập qua private network
    của Render (internal DB URL)
  • Mọi kết nối dùng chuỗi trong
    biến môi trường `DATABASE_URL`
  • Persistent storage: Render Disk
end note

note bottom of ApiSvc
  **Secret / Environment variables**
  (Render Environment Variables,
   mã hóa at rest – KHÔNG nằm trong repo)

  • `DATABASE_URL` (internal DB URL)
  • `JWT_SECRET` (random ≥ 32 bytes)
  • `NODE_ENV=production`
  • `PORT` (Render cấp)
  • `PAYMENT_PROVIDER=mock`

  **Health check**
  • `GET /health` → 200 + trạng thái DB
  • Render dùng làm Health Check Path
  • CD pipeline gọi smoke test sau deploy
end note

note bottom of WebSvc
  **Secret / Environment variables**
  • `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`
    = https://brewlite-api.onrender.com
  • `NODE_ENV=production`

  **Log**
  • stdout/stderr → Render log stream
  • `requestId` trong log để truy vết
end note

note bottom of CI
  **Secret trong CI**
  (GitHub Actions Secrets – không lộ trong log)
  • `DOCKERHUB_USERNAME`, `DOCKERHUB_TOKEN`
  • `RENDER_API_KEY`
  • `RENDER_WEB_SERVICE_ID`, `RENDER_API_SERVICE_ID`
  • `POSTGRES_PASSWORD`, `JWT_SECRET`
end note

note bottom of Local
  **Ranh giới LOCAL**
  • `cp .env.example .env` → `docker compose up`
  • Postgres có healthcheck; API chỉ
    khởi động sau khi DB `healthy`
  • API chạy `prisma migrate deploy` + seed
  • Chỉ dùng cho phát triển, KHÔNG
    dùng dữ liệu production
end note

legend right
  |= Ký hiệu |= Ý nghĩa |
  | <b>HTTPS 443</b> | Giao thức public qua Internet |
  | <b>Internal</b> | Mạng nội bộ Render, không public |
  | <b><:sha></b> | Image tag theo commit SHA |
  | Ranh giới | Docker container / private network |
endlegend

@enduml
